{"4517460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Total Football Online", "steam_appid": 4517460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4774220], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Massive Football IP Licenses, Authentic Competition Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Licensed by FIFPRO™, Manchester City, and national teams including Germany, France, and Portugal, Total Football Online allows you to collect legendary icons—such as Ronaldinho, Klose, Cafu, Raúl, Scholes, and Giggs—and lead them to glory on the pitch! Smooth, responsive controls powered by our innovative physics engine, deliver a truly immersive experience. Whether you want to relive legendary matches or enjoy epic battles between the greats, Total Football Online guarantees a thrilling and authentic football journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517460/extras/04df8d59361c6ebaf2fccc71a58af584.avif?t=1786518753\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517460/extras_big/04df8d59361c6ebaf2fccc71a58af584.webp?t=1786518753 width=1560 height=598 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Precision Algorithm, Unrivaled Excellence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total Football Online utilizes a world-leading Neural Network AI algorithm, the Motion Matching engine, and Asia's premier motion capture technology. Together, these technologies deliver the most authentic facial details and player movements, along with seamless controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517460/extras/d8665511a1060225fb3897dd9c4f4bb3.poster.avif?t=1786518753\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517460/extras/d8665511a1060225fb3897dd9c4f4bb3.webm?t=1786518753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517460/extras/d8665511a1060225fb3897dd9c4f4bb3.mp4?t=1786518753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Authentic Stadiums, Perfect Simulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total Football Online not only renders massive match scenes with 50,000+ spectators under full global lighting but also powers realistic muscle deformations and dynamic jersey physics, creating an immersive experience that puts you right on the pitch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517460/extras/729b4297abb872c72f423291e6b3a21c.avif?t=1786518753\" width=1374 height=654 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free Customization, Your Pitch, Your Rules!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pitch, your rules! Customize your stadium, team logo, jersey, and tifos to build your own elite club and set your home turf ablaze!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517460/extras/793b5b6aae83a416d3ebaf191f6bf7ff.avif?t=1786518753\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517460/extras_big/793b5b6aae83a416d3ebaf191f6bf7ff.avif?t=1786518753 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy Controls, Pure Football</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total Football Online's license roster has been further expanded, now featuring full licensing for five major national teams. Three legendary icons—all-time World Cup top scorer Miroslav Klose, long-range specialist Diego Forlán, and midfield magician Deco—alongside the standout names from the 25/26 UEFA competitions, are now available. Gameplay tempo has been completely overhauled, featuring lightning-fast dribbling, dynamic off-ball movement, and enhanced precision defense. With ultra-smooth controls, taking control of the game has never felt more natural. Return to the joy of pure football—ignite the game with your speed and dominate with your strategy. Your new era of football begins now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517460/extras/ebb32ffc6470d3dee866148a077ce3a1.avif?t=1786518753\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517460/extras_big/ebb32ffc6470d3dee866148a077ce3a1.avif?t=1786518753 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GALA Sports (02458.HK) is a world-leading developer specializing in sports games. It possesses the licenses from FIFPRO™, NBA, and MLB, the TOP 3 sports IPs, and has established deep partnerships with elite sports clubs such as Manchester City and the LA Lakers, as well as sports icons including Ronaldinho, Miroslav Klose, Derrick Rose, and Jimmy Butler. Its titles cover a variety of fields spanning basketball, football, baseball, and fishing, all having achieved both commercial success and critical acclaim. Upholding the strategy of merging IP licensing with innovative gameplay, GALA Sports is dedicated to bringing immersive and fun sports gaming experiences to players worldwide.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Massive Football IP Licenses, Authentic Competition Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Licensed by FIFPRO™, Manchester City, and national teams including Germany, France, and Portugal, Total Football Online allows you to collect legendary icons—such as Ronaldinho, Klose, Cafu, Raúl, Scholes, and Giggs—and lead them to glory on the pitch! Smooth, responsive controls powered by our innovative physics engine, deliver a truly immersive experience. Whether you want to relive legendary matches or enjoy epic battles between the greats, Total Football Online guarantees a thrilling and authentic football journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517460/extras/04df8d59361c6ebaf2fccc71a58af584.avif?t=1786518753\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517460/extras_big/04df8d59361c6ebaf2fccc71a58af584.webp?t=1786518753 width=1560 height=598 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Precision Algorithm, Unrivaled Excellence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total Football Online utilizes a world-leading Neural Network AI algorithm, the Motion Matching engine, and Asia's premier motion capture technology. Together, these technologies deliver the most authentic facial details and player movements, along with seamless controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517460/extras/d8665511a1060225fb3897dd9c4f4bb3.poster.avif?t=1786518753\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517460/extras/d8665511a1060225fb3897dd9c4f4bb3.webm?t=1786518753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517460/extras/d8665511a1060225fb3897dd9c4f4bb3.mp4?t=1786518753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Authentic Stadiums, Perfect Simulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total Football Online not only renders massive match scenes with 50,000+ spectators under full global lighting but also powers realistic muscle deformations and dynamic jersey physics, creating an immersive experience that puts you right on the pitch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517460/extras/729b4297abb872c72f423291e6b3a21c.avif?t=1786518753\" width=1374 height=654 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free Customization, Your Pitch, Your Rules!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your pitch, your rules! Customize your stadium, team logo, jersey, and tifos to build your own elite club and set your home turf ablaze!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517460/extras/793b5b6aae83a416d3ebaf191f6bf7ff.avif?t=1786518753\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517460/extras_big/793b5b6aae83a416d3ebaf191f6bf7ff.avif?t=1786518753 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy Controls, Pure Football</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total Football Online's license roster has been further expanded, now featuring full licensing for five major national teams. Three legendary icons—all-time World Cup top scorer Miroslav Klose, long-range specialist Diego Forlán, and midfield magician Deco—alongside the standout names from the 25/26 UEFA competitions, are now available. Gameplay tempo has been completely overhauled, featuring lightning-fast dribbling, dynamic off-ball movement, and enhanced precision defense. With ultra-smooth controls, taking control of the game has never felt more natural. Return to the joy of pure football—ignite the game with your speed and dominate with your strategy. Your new era of football begins now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517460/extras/ebb32ffc6470d3dee866148a077ce3a1.avif?t=1786518753\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517460/extras_big/ebb32ffc6470d3dee866148a077ce3a1.avif?t=1786518753 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GALA Sports (02458.HK) is a world-leading developer specializing in sports games. It possesses the licenses from FIFPRO™, NBA, and MLB, the TOP 3 sports IPs, and has established deep partnerships with elite sports clubs such as Manchester City and the LA Lakers, as well as sports icons including Ronaldinho, Miroslav Klose, Derrick Rose, and Jimmy Butler. Its titles cover a variety of fields spanning basketball, football, baseball, and fishing, all having achieved both commercial success and critical acclaim. Upholding the strategy of merging IP licensing with innovative gameplay, GALA Sports is dedicated to bringing immersive and fun sports gaming experiences to players worldwide.</p>", "short_description": "Build your All-Star lineup in Total Football Online! Easy to pick up, it lets you dive into pure football fun at your fingertips. With events and player updates syncing with real-world tournaments, get ready for a truly immersive football experience.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Russian, Thai, Vietnamese, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517460/f243cb4ce0d8322a17620d4ea470e41a966b84f1/header.jpg?t=1786518753", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517460/58117c2ba2627a4552fb4e414b487fc0e574532e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786518753", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4517460/58117c2ba2627a4552fb4e414b487fc0e574532e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786518753", "website": null, "pc_requi